{
  "$comment": "Resolve the ImageProfile of one model (方案 §4.3–§4.6, §7). Input: the metadata slice in wire shape (profiles.image + providers.<kind>.models and providers.<kind>.imageModels, both maps keyed by wire model id whose entries carry imageProfile / imageProfileOverride; models wins on a shared id) and a provider kind + model id (relay: officialMatch is { providerKind, modelId }), optionally a relay connection context (officialMatch from the Server alias table, probe state, user-declared / probed profile). Output: which profile applies (profileRef, or \"user_declared\" for a connection-level profile) or null with a closed reason. Any unknown enum value or a transport the route does not allow makes the profile unusable — never fall back to chat. visibilityCases lock where a resolved model appears in the studio model list (§7). Executable reference: scripts/lib/studio-image-reference.mjs resolveProfile / visibleInStudio.",
